node_modules/
# dist/ IS committed (2026-09-17) -- manaramp consumes this package as a `github:` dependency from
# a clean CI checkout (Cloudflare's build) that can't reliably run this repo's own `prepare`/build
# step (confirmed: even a plain local `npm install` silently skipped devDependencies+prepare for a
# git-sourced dependency, and Cloudflare's own npm additionally gates lifecycle scripts behind an
# "allow-scripts" allowlist) -- so dist/ has to already be real, working files in the git tree
# itself, not a build artifact regenerated on install. Rebuild + recommit dist/ (`npm run build`)
# before pushing any src/ change that should reach manaramp.
arena_settings.json
*.mcpb
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
